'''Vusk''' was a [[Gender|male]] [[Kassk]] [[pirate]]<ref name="KCBL" /> in the [[Warbird gang]]. He had [[Color|yellow]] skin, green [[eye]]s, and wore white [[scout trooper armor]] with red markings.<ref name="AQSR" />

{{Char-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Vusk was first identified by the credits of "[[A Quick Salvage Run]]," in which the character was voiced by [[Jason Hightower]].<ref name="AQSR" /> In early drafts of "[[Kaz's Curse]]," Vusk was originally the pirate who put a curse on [[Kazuda Xiono]], before it was changed to the [[Nikto]] [[Leoz]].<ref name="KCBL" />

